   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "FILTERS & ADJUSTMENTS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 2, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Filter\n   2 Exposure\n   3 Warmth and tint\n   4 Film texture\n   5 Shot matching\n   6 Texture effect\n   7 Retro look\n   8 Filter family\n   9 LUT (a color recipe)\n  10 Color wheels\n  11 Color curves\n  12 suite: Dream sequence\n  13 suite: Silent film\n  14 suite: Zine scrapbook\n  15 suite: Old home video\n  16 suite: Final Cut finishing pass\nCV-CC 2: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 2, CC 17 to 31\n   1 suite: True to life grade\n   2 suite: Summer blockbuster grade\n   3 pair: When the focus pulls to an object, the shadows turn\n   4 pair: When the night filter goes on, the scene plays as night\n   5 pair: When the picture is blown out, the whole room seems to glow\n   6 pair: When the color is pushed very warm, the place feels cozy\n   7 pair: When the image turns gritty, the world feels harsh\n   8 pair: When a shot is graded to clash on purpose, the feeling jumps\n   9 pair: When the blacks are crushed, the contrast jumps\n  10 pair: When the teal and orange recipe goes on, skin stays warm while the rest turns teal\n  11 pair: When a movie filter goes on, black bars come with it\n  12 pair: When the picture gets a polaroid look, copies stack like photos on a table\n  13 pair: When it looks like old home video, the feeling turns bittersweet\n  14 pairs: Memory box\n  15 pairs: Hard-edge grade"
   },
